# Written at runtime by .github/workflows/deploy-distribution.yml from the
# GSC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON secret. It was previously committed containing the
# literal text "${{ secrets.GSC_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON }}" - an unexpanded
# workflow expression sitting in a file named like a credential, which reads as
# a real key to anyone scanning the repo and would shadow the runtime file.
gsc-service-account.json
